<title>SINGAPORE: HOLD-DBS to list additional ordinary sha.</title>
<headline>HOLD-DBS to list additional ordinary sha.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Development Bank of Singapore (DBS) Ltd said on Thursday that 90,937 ordinary shares worth S$1 each will be listed and quoted with effect at 0100 GMT on Friday, October 4.</p>
<p>The shares came about from the conversion of 469,240 non-redeemable convertible preference shares, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>An additional 63 ordinary shares rounded up to the nearest 100 shares will also be listed and quoted with effect beginning at the same on Friday.</p>
<p>- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
